recommend keep-going the pre-push refusal and the debride-announces-itself line are both Keaton's word, so the next agent-doable crux is the untraced dated_path instability -- one tree, two numbers, and a census nobody can trust twice is worth more than a ceiling; after it, the twelve remaining xargs sites want one shared portable helper, and `hunk` at 86 is still the largest family with no clock
